__NOTOC__
The first tournament in the TQA series was called '''Revival''' and was held in May of 2003. A large number of players from different cities of Russia came to the tournament - from Ufa, Surgut, Moscow, Ekaterinburg, Perm, Novy Urengoy and many others.

A slightly strange situation occurred in LB6 - organizers held matches between each other players, who lost in WB, and players who won in LB.

